# ECC Workflow Integration
- Adhere to Everything Claude Code (ECC) engineering standards:
  - Research & Reuse: check existing GitHub code first
  - Plan First: architecture and sequence before coding
  - TDD: write failing tests first, pass minimally, refactor
  - Code Review: audit diffs for edge cases, null safety, regressions
  - Zero-Secret Law: never commit keys, tokens, or credentials
